'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Death domain can summon an enhanced shadow and gains spells related to death and dying.[[Image:Id death.gif|right|Death]]
== Domain special abilities ==

*Negative plane avatar: The [[cleric]] is able to summon a [[shadow]] that scales according to the cleric's [[class level]].

== Bonus spells ==
* Level 4: [[Phantasmal killer]]
* Level 5: [[Enervation]]

== Notes ==

* The negative plane avatar can be summoned once per [[day]].
*The avatar has an identical progression (though based on cleric levels) to the [[summon shadow (shadow conjuration)|shadow conjuration summon]].

